WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:05.450
Well, you sure seem to be 
having a good time, Haru...

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.790
Without me and all.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:10.750
Kuro!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.010
That's weird... It's already 11:00.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.690
Hmm?

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:25.720
I think I'm the one who should 
be saying this is weird.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.160
Am I wrong?

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.800
Uh, well...

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.540
In which case, don't you have 
something you want to say?

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.350
Oh, you're gonna go there, huh?

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:36.050
Like you're any better?

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:39.800
Oh, what's this? Picking a fight, Haru?

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.890
Kuro-nee! You can't go on a 
rampage when everyone's here!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.470
Let go of me, Midori!

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:47.160
And what do you mean, go on a rampage?!

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:48.050
I'm sorry for the ruckus.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:49.650
Hey!

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.920
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:26.410
So, Tetsuhiko-kun, what's 
the plan after this?

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:29.990
I'd like to see your singing and 
dancing first, Shida-chan.

00:02:29.990 --> 00:02:31.890
We can try putting all three together.

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.130
Okay.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:35.740
After lunch, we'll set up the stage,

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.830
and those who need to study will study.

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:40.350
But we should play on the beach 
for a bit after we eat.

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:44.560
I'd feel bad making you do nothing but 
help after coming all the way here.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:47.060
Shida-chan, they can spare an hour, right?

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.570
Well, if it's only an hour.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:07.940
Maria-chan has the balance I expected,

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:10.070
but Shida-chan's not far behind at all.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:11.310
Here you go.

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:13.590
Yeah, and Kuro's a good singer.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:16.470
Kachi's gotten a lot better, too.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.850
You okay?

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:21.650
I'm fine. Thank you.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:22.500
Shiro!

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:24.380
You've gotten a lot better.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.590
Really, Su-chan?

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:27.780
Yeah.

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:31.670
If that's true, your advice must 
have been right on point.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:35.150
<i>I was glad to see it didn't look 
like anything had happened,</i>

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:36.140
<i>but this...</i>

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:39.930
I guess that's my only choice.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:47.790
Man, this feels great!

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.300
The beach rocks!

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:55.760
Haru-niisan!

00:03:56.740 --> 00:03:57.990
Haru-nii.

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:00.720
Wait, where's Kuro?

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:03.170
Oh... Kuro-neesan is...

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.520
She may be a childhood friend,

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:20.600
but this is your first time seeing her in a 
swimsuit as a potential love interest, eh?

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.960
The hell are you doing?!

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.310
You're wrong! I'm not captivated!

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:26.900
Hey!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.390
Let go, Stupidharu.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.820
Why do you have a watermelon?

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:40.630
We can't come to the beach 
and not break a watermelon!

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.920
All right! Let's crush it!

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.030
Kuro-nee!

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:50.820
That girl over there is the Akutami 
Award-winning novelist, Kachi-san, isn't she?

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.760
Why ask that now? You saw her once before.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:57.490
Yeah, but only for a second.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.470
Now that I get a good look, 
she's really pretty.

00:05:00.470 --> 00:05:02.430
You're no match for her.

00:05:02.430 --> 00:05:03.280
In what way?

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:04.360
Your face.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:05.070
Your height.

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:05.780
Your chest.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:08.880
Wow, Midori, you've got some guts.

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.730
I like you, Midori-chan. 
You're a very honest girl.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:13.890
Why don't you and I have a chat?

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:15.110
Wow, really?!

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.870
Of course.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.240
You're in trouble, Kuro-nee!

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.310
She's way ahead of you in personality, too!

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:25.370
The only thing you've got on her 
is your blackheartedness!

00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:26.770
Midori!

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.590
Come on, Kuro, just calm down...

00:05:31.590 --> 00:05:34.630
There's something I want 
to say to you, Haru.

00:05:36.930 --> 00:05:38.100
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.560
Sorry, everyone. We'll be right back.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.560
Ow, ow, ow!

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:42.730
Kuro, wait a minute!

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:44.270
Sueharu... Rest in peace.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.690
Ow!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:51.680
Haru-san, you lashed out at 
me the moment we got here.

00:05:51.680 --> 00:05:54.420
I know why. You're mad at me, aren't you?

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:56.510
Y-Yeah, that's right.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:59.870
I mean, you lied to me, 
and you won't even apologize.

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:02.740
What's wrong with me being mad?

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:04.200
Hmm...

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.640
K-Kuro?!

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:11.510
You don't trust me, do you, Haru?

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:16.900
So from now on, I'll say, 
"I love you," ten times as often.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.370
What? Got a problem with that?

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:19.940
That's...

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.800
It's fine. I'm just gonna say, 
"I love you," whenever I feel like it.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.230
You can just listen and 
take it as a joke, right?

00:06:27.460 --> 00:06:31.440
<i>K-Kuro's fallen all the 
way to the dark side!</i>

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.490
<b>Ultimate Kuroha</b>

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:32.490
<b>Dark</b>

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:33.570
Ultimate Kuroha!

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.410
<b></b><Demon Race • Effect • Fusion>

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.410
<b></b>[Appears] After summer break 
[Finishing Move] Converts all defensive power
 to offensive power.
 Becomes extremely assertive.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.580
<b></b>[Appears] With amnesia 
[Skill] Pure and innocent. Shy.

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:38.910
<b></b><Angel Race • Effect>

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.510
Pure Kuroha!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.120
<b>Light</b>

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.120
<b>Pure Kuroha</b>

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:39.710
<b>Light</b>

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:41.170
<b>Sergeant Kuroha</b>

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.160
Sergeant Kuroha!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.840
<b></b><Warrior Race ・ Ritual>

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.840
<b></b>[Appears] For high school entrance exams 
[Attribute]Beast Sergeant

00:06:43.010 --> 00:06:45.720
<i>This is different from all the 
other Kurohas I've seen!</i>

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.600
<i>I should call her... I know!</i>

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:48.340
<b></b>[Attribute] Super sadist 
[Skill] Entangling sex appeal 
[Finishing Move] "I love you" 1000%

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:48.470
<b></b><Illusion Race ・ Counter>

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:50.160
Alter Kuroha!

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.130
<b>Alter Kuroha</b>

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:49.130
<b>Snare</b>

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.720
<b>Alter Kuroha</b>

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.720
<b>Snare</b>

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.840
<b>Alter Kuroha</b>

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.840
<b>Snare</b>

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:54.380
For now, consider this 
a declaration of war.

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.510
You'd better be ready.

00:06:57.990 --> 00:07:00.860
<i>Sh-She's completely in this mode now.</i>

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:11.960
You look a little sexy when 
your hair's all wet.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.150
I love you.

00:07:13.930 --> 00:07:16.860
What's wrong, Haru? Your face is red.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:20.740
How cute. You don't need 
to try to act tough.

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:22.000
I love you.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.330
Manta!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.220
Hey, Haru, are you okay?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.970
I love you.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:35.970
Hey, now.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.430
Tired or not, you still 
have to study later.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.510
I love you.

00:07:43.750 --> 00:07:45.560
Worn out, Haru?

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.060
I love you.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:55.800
Damn Kuroha! Why is she saying 
"I love you" like it's a tic now?!

00:07:56.630 --> 00:08:00.460
I'm scared! It scares me that 
she even came up with this!

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:03.360
She's totally messing with me.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:06.400
No! I can't be like this!

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:08.530
I'm fighting with Kuro right now!

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:13.040
Until she apologizes, until she tells me 
why she lied, I'm not gonna forgiv—

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.300
I love you.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.650
I'm stuck in the Shisa!

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:26.440
Yo, what the hell are you doing?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.470
Shida-chan says it's time to start studying,
 so get a move on.

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:34.580
I made up this test for you.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:37.690
There are five subjects, and you 
have 30 minutes to complete each.

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:43.210
Also, we can't be the only ones to 
get out of setting up the stage,

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:46.240
so we'll be taking a break 
to go out and help.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.700
That doesn't seem like much of a break.

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:49.950
Got a problem?

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.360
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:07.330
<i>This problem looks a lot like 
one I got wrong before.</i>

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:13.570
<i>Did she make this test based on 
problems I got wrong in the past?</i>

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:17.010
<i>Wouldn't it be really hard to 
put together a test like that?</i>

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:21.020
<i>And she had to practice the 
song and dance, too...</i>

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.300
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:30.980
<i>Everyone said I couldn't get into this 
high school because it's a prep school,</i>

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.820
<i>but I got in because of Kuro.</i>

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:40.730
<i>Kuro has always been...</i>

00:09:47.090 --> 00:09:48.280
Haru?

00:09:48.280 --> 00:09:50.030
Sorry, it's nothing.

00:09:50.030 --> 00:09:51.790
Just psyching myself up a little.

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:54.020
Finally feeling motivated?

00:09:54.020 --> 00:09:54.760
Yeah.

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:57.980
You take way too long 
getting to that point.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.000
I love you.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:07.000
Osamake: Romcom Where
The Childhood Friend Won't Lose

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:07.000
<b>Episode 9
Paradise SOS</b>

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:07.000
<b>Huh?</b>

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:07.000
<b>Nothing!</b>

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:12.760
And... there.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:15.590
Haru-nii, where are you 
putting the speakers?

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.760
You're wondering about that?

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.460
Oh, that's right. 
You're in the light music club.

00:10:20.460 --> 00:10:22.170
How's that going? You enjoying it?

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:26.630
I don't get along with the other members, 
so I haven't attended since summer break.

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:29.390
Oh... How did you not get along with them?

00:10:29.390 --> 00:10:34.620
Well, I want to get better at playing 
my instrument, but they never practice.

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:37.110
They all suck at theirs, 
but all they do is talk trash,

00:10:37.110 --> 00:10:38.370
so I stopped caring.

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:41.380
Ah, I see. That must've been rough.

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:46.080
I never knew you had so many friends.

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:49.420
Do I look like someone who 
doesn't have many friends?

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:53.040
Oh, sorry, Haru-nii. 
That's not what I meant.

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:59.760
Watching you talk to people I don't know 
just made you seem kind of far away.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:01.470
Akane...

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:03.710
Okay.

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:05.630
Hey, Tetsuhiko.

00:11:05.630 --> 00:11:08.590
Akane has a suggestion for 
where the speakers should go.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:12.970
Just say what you want to 
say. I'll back you up.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:14.970
Sure, let's hear it.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:29.290
I love it!

00:11:29.510 --> 00:11:31.410
That's pretty awesome, Akane.

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:33.860
I didn't know you were that good at this.

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:36.250
Yeah... Thanks, Haru-nii.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:38.710
I didn't even do anything.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:41.240
Still, thank you.

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:54.610
Shiro, you okay?

00:11:54.610 --> 00:11:57.270
Oh... Yes, I'm fine.

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:59.320
It just feels a little strange.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.170
Oh, yeah. You're the only one who 
kept practicing for two whole days.

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.070
Midori, could you take a look at Shiro?

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:08.740
Do you feel any pain here?

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.280
Yes, a bit.

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:14.090
We can fix this up with a bit of taping.

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:17.690
A compress would help, too. I'll go get one.

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:18.760
Thanks...

00:12:18.760 --> 00:12:20.120
Can you walk?

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.470
Yes, I'm fine.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:51.950
Shiro...

00:12:52.320 --> 00:12:55.320
Even with an injured foot, 
she's still practicing this late.

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.040
Hi, Meiko.

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:02.920
Thanks for calling me back.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.830
Sorry to make you call so late.

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.980
Why am I hiding?

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:11.830
Yeah. I'm the only one who's bad 
at it, so I have to practice.

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:16.480
No, I have no intention of 
asking Su-chan for help.

00:13:17.850 --> 00:13:19.930
I realized yesterday that

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:23.510
I don't need to push myself too 
hard to stand next to him.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:26.850
I want to walk a step behind him,

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:31.150
and be the one to prop him up 
when he gets into trouble.

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.560
<i>Shiro feels the same way as me.</i>

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.220
I'm going to try to be more honest,

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:42.270
and rely on Su-chan for help 
and advice from now on.

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:46.500
But I think it's wrong to rely 
on him unconditionally.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:51.150
I feel it's rude to start being dependent 
before I've done whatever I can myself.

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:57.300
I won't be going back to the days when 
I just clung to Su-chan unconditionally.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:00.440
Meiko, thanks for listening.

00:14:01.410 --> 00:14:03.270
Okay, talk to you later.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:07.110
Well, back to work.

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:18.750
<i>I want to show Su-chan that 
I can do it when I try.</i>

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:24.970
<i>I want to let him know that 
I am who I am because of him.</i>

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.670
You can do it, Shiro.

00:14:45.520 --> 00:14:47.330
<i>First love is poison.</i>

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:51.760
<i>I thought I had eased the 
pain with a new love.</i>

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:54.510
<i>But the poison of my first love</i>

00:14:55.530 --> 00:14:57.770
<i>is still eating away at me.</i>

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.670
Akane-chan...

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:20.630
Aoi, I don't know why, but my heart hurts.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.260
Akane-chan?

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:26.920
Why, though? This has 
never happened before.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:31.120
But when I look at Haru-nii, 
my chest feels all tight.

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:38.130
<i>No, Akane-chan. Don't.</i>

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:43.380
<i>It's poison. What you're feeling 
can't be anything but poison.</i>

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.220
<i>No light will ever touch it.</i>

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:50.760
<i>And yet, even the smallest things 
will make you so happy.</i>

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:53.350
<i>You'll get all excited, even giddy.</i>

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.730
<i>But in the end, you'll just be sad.</i>

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:02.190
<i>I know my feelings clash with 
my beloved Kuro-neesan's.</i>

00:16:02.550 --> 00:16:05.300
<i>Maybe with Midori-neesan's, too.</i>

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:07.940
<i>But is there...</i>

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:11.700
<i>Is there no chance for me at all?</i>

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:14.380
Aoi, you're hurting me.

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:15.790
Sorry...

00:16:16.260 --> 00:16:17.680
Are you okay?

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.680
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.420
I'm glad.

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:25.360
<i>If love really is poison...</i>

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:29.640
<i>Then for me, lies are medicine.</i>

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:34.300
<i>Not medicine to heal me, though.</i>

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:36.760
<i>All for everyone else.</i>

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:42.310
<i>It's a painkiller that lets me get away 
with claiming a noble cause like that.</i>

00:16:43.070 --> 00:16:46.550
<i>Also, after I use this medicine, it hurts.</i>

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:51.690
<i>Because the more I lie, the stronger 
these feelings I shouldn't have get.</i>

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:57.290
<i>Hey, Haru-niisan, please tell me...</i>

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:00.200
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:10.400
Oh, Haru...

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:11.450
Hey, Shiro.

00:17:11.960 --> 00:17:13.330
How's your foot doing?

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:16.160
It's just fine.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:18.380
Really? Let me take a look.

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:19.930
W-Wait, Su-chan...

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.870
Does it hurt here? How about here?

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:24.410
Su-chan...

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.550
What do you think that's
all about, Tetsu-senpai?

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:26.560
Don't do lewd things in front of everyone.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.920
Huh? What'd you say?

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.160
Yeah, I dunno, either.

00:17:27.920 --> 00:17:29.650
Uh, nothing.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:33.110
I may have taken this a bit too lightly.

00:17:33.860 --> 00:17:35.080
Momo-chi?

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:36.590
Can you make it, Shiro?

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:38.420
Yeah. Thanks.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.300
Keep it up.

00:17:40.300 --> 00:17:41.040
I will.

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:32.510
<i>You did it. You really did your best,</i>

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:34.630
<i>Shiro.</i>

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:36.600
Okay, that's it.

00:19:36.600 --> 00:19:39.250
That was good, right? It was perfect!

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:42.840
We still have some time. 
Should we do one more take?

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:45.120
No way, no way! It'll never 
get any better than that!

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.740
There's no need to do it again! That was enough!

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:50.210
What're you getting all heated about?

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.180
Su-chan, what's wrong?

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:53.400
Ow!

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:54.740
Shiro!

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.150
Ow!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:09.090
Su-chan!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:11.280
Haru!

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.690
Sueharu-oniichan!

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.710
Hey, Rena, look up nearby hospitals.

00:20:15.710 --> 00:20:16.740
Roger!

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:18.660
Eri-san, start the car.

00:20:19.510 --> 00:20:21.400
Midori-chan, can you give him first aid?

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.620
Su-chan... This is my fault.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:22.420
Y-Yes!

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:26.840
Shiro... You're still such a crybaby.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:31.850
Don't worry about me. This is no big deal.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:34.360
Su-chan...

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:42.790
Mind if I interrupt?

00:20:43.150 --> 00:20:45.970
As long as you know that's 
what you're doing.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.750
You're interrupting. Could you leave?

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:51.930
I've started to look forward 
to these reactions of yours.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.640
I'm glad you met my expectations.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.110
Are you that masochistic?

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:57.210
I'll have to deny that.

00:20:57.210 --> 00:21:00.920
It's just that there's no one else 
who reacts to me like you do.

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.730
It just feels so new.

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:08.450
<b>Okinawa Specialty 
Mugwort Extract 

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:08.450
<b>Help yourself</b>

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:06.300
Anyway, how'd the filming trip go?

00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.440
You're gonna hang around until I tell you?

00:21:08.730 --> 00:21:11.520
Actually, I got into Keio 
U on a recommendation,

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.010
so thankfully, I have 
ample time on my hands.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:20.510
Shooting that PV with the girls was 
all I wanted out of that trip.

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:24.170
I didn't really get involved 
between the four of them.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.440
If I had to name a winner,

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:28.130
it'd definitely be Kachi.

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:29.360
Oh?

00:21:29.510 --> 00:21:32.750
Maria-chan was so scared of Shida-chan

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.350
that she didn't do anything 
to try to stop Kachi.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:36.570
That's how I saw it.

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:40.880
Kachi must've thought that if she wanted 
to stop Shida-chan's intense attack,

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:44.340
it'd work out better for her 
to be a bit more competitive.

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:46.520
But that was a mistake.

00:21:46.960 --> 00:21:50.740
On the last day, all three of 
us filmed them on the stage,

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:53.290
and this is Sueharu's.

00:21:53.290 --> 00:21:56.700
Huh... It's nothing but 
shots of Shirokusa-chan.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.800
Obvious, right?

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:00.850
It's strange.

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:05.510
Based on what Shirokusa-chan told me,
 all she did was screw up.

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:08.370
What on earth happened 
between the two of them?

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:12.130
I didn't see it myself, so to 
be honest, I have no idea.

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:15.690
I guess it means that just 
because the plan failed,

00:22:15.690 --> 00:22:19.150
it doesn't mean she failed 
in the romantic aspect.

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:26.610
<b>Okinawa Specialty 
Mugwort Extract 

00:22:19.920 --> 00:22:26.610
Does that mean Shirokusa-chan failing
actually made his protective instinct kick in?

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:29.330
Well, if we're being frank about it.

00:22:29.480 --> 00:22:31.340
In which case,

00:22:31.340 --> 00:22:34.940
rather than the pushy, 
aggressive Shida-san,

00:22:34.940 --> 00:22:40.000
Maru-kun prefers someone like Shirokusa-chan,
 who's clumsy but always does her best?

00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:42.740
That's what I've thought all along.

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:45.800
I mean, he was in love with
 Kachi, not Shida-chan.

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:48.630
Oh, yeah, that's right.

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:50.760
Which means this is going 
to be quite a mess.

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:52.500
How so?

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:53.480
Because...

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:57.680
Maru-kun and Shirokusa-chan are going 
to live in the same house together.

00:23:01.130 --> 00:23:02.970
Huh? What do you mean?

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:05.180
Just what I said.

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:09.190
To take responsibility for your injury, 
Shiro is going to stay at your house

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:10.650
and take care of all your needs.

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:15.070
With your dominant arm in that shape, 
you'll have a hard time getting by.

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:17.630
I've already talked it 
over with your father.

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:24.280
B-But making a teenage girl live with a 
male classmate just because of that...

00:23:24.280 --> 00:23:26.250
It won't be Shiro alone, of course.

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:28.080
She will be staying there, too.

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:30.160
I can look after Haru!

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:34.050
Shida-san, I'm the one who hurt Su-chan.

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:36.780
Let me take responsibility for that.
